WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.450
What happened during the first test?

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.070
It started fine.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.890
Okay, Anna. Is your seatbelt buckled?

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:12.770
Yes, sir!

5
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.350
Great. Please start the car.

6
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.390
Okay, Anna, start the car.

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:21.810
Started the car.

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.290
Good job, Anna.

9
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.830
Why are you talking to yourself?

10
00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.930
I am a little nervous.

11
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.570
When I'm nervous, I talk to myself.

12
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.350
You don't need to be nervous.

13
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:37.370
Listen to that engine!

14
00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.970
Please, stop pushing the gas pedal.

15
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:42.590
Sorry.

16
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:45.650
Okay, when you are ready, turn.

17
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:46.130
Great!

18
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.570
Not now! You almost hit that car!

19
00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.230
You said “turn!”

20
00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.770
Look first! There were cars in the street.

21
00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:55.170
Please don’t yell at me!

22
00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:57.970
I’m sorry! I was afraid.

23
00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.350
You were yelling.

24
00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.030
Look out for that car! Brake! Brake!!

25
00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.170
Why is everyone honking at us?

26
00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:07.050
You were driving too slow!

27
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.410
Anna, stay on the street!

28
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.670
Hands on the wheel, Anna.

29
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:14.990
What’s that sound?

30
00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:18.290
That, Anna, is the police.

31
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.350
That sounds awful.

32
00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.270
Yes, it did not go well.

33
00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:34.010
But, I practiced and passed the second time!

34
00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:39.850
Do you know where you want to take your first drive in Washington, D.C.?

35
00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.670
Yes! Let’s go!

36
00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.550
There it is … the White House!
